  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Roll out the vegan shortcrust pastry on a floured surface to a thickness of about 1/8 inch (3 mm).",
    "Transfer the pastry to a 9x13 inch baking dish and trim the edges to fit.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the Marmite, olive oil, minced garlic, chopped rosemary, chopped thyme, and chopped lemon zest.",
    "Brush the Marmite mixture evenly over the pastry, leaving a 1-inch (2.5 cm) border around the edges.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Bake the pastry for 25-30 minutes, or until golden brown.",
    "Remove the pastry from the oven and let it cool for 5 minutes before slicing into squares.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!",
    "If desired, reheat the pastry in the oven for an additional 5-10 minutes before serving."
  ],
